   "text": "StagingLoader (shared by both flows)\nclean CSV -> clear earlier rows of this FileId\n-> bulk insert (4 connections when >= 20k rows, 1,000-row chunks)\n-> Load* proc under GET_LOCK secr_load_<staging table>\n-> report proc under GET_LOCK secr_report_<id>_<proc>",
